  "id": "cinnamon-raisin-walnut-rugelach",
  "name": "Cinnamon Raisin Walnut Rugelach",
  "subtitle": "Tender pastry spirals with cinnamon, raisins, and walnuts",
  "description": "Cream-cheese pastry is filled with apricot jam, spiced fruit, and nuts, then rolled, glazed, and baked until lightly browned and fully set.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
  "yield": {
